    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94273" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐπύ-η</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meal-tub</i>, <i><span class="en">
